{"product_id":"seekers-great-bear-lake","title":"Seekers: Great Bear Lake","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe epic tale of three abandoned bear cubs on the journey of a lifetime. On the Longest Day they join hundreds of black, grizzly and polar bears at Great Bear Lake to ask for the help of the mystical bear-spirits. Surviving the wild is not easy the climate is changing and the food is scarce. Lusa decides to leave the safety of the zoo to find Toklo, a grizzly whose mother died in captivity. But Toklo does not welcome Lusa. Why would he want a black bear for a friend? Meanwhile, Kallik, a young polar bear, searches alone for her lost brother. She knows she must find the place where the spirits dance above endless ice. But the way is filled with danger, and Kallik needs all her courage to follow natureÅ¼s path. Lusa, Toklo and Kallik discover their real strength lies in friendship. Only together will they survive the quest through the harsh wilderness. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:128 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Erin Hunter \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781405246101 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 419\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43691069735065,"sku":"11RD9781405246101","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/5797d1691e63e963fc2205e356bce050.jpg?v=1752150832","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/seekers-great-bear-lake","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}